window.products.push({"id":697017,"name":"Baxton Studio Beds (Platform), Queen, Grey/Walnut Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":475.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nk-D6rhlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The contemporary Gretchen bed is the ideal piece to transform any bedroom. The most striking aspect of the Gretchen is its cushioned wingback headboard, which provides excellent and cozy back support when sitting in bed. Made in Malaysia, the Gretchen bed is protected by soft fabric and supported by a sturdy, walnut brown finished wood base. This platform bed requires assembly and is fitted with wood slats, eliminating the need for a box spring. The symmetry found in the Gretchen’s design creates a unique take on modern comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nk-D6rhlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B0BK5QJVYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK5QJVYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK5QJVYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697018,"name":"Wemore Heated Electric Blanket Throw, Soft Sherpa Heating Blanket with 10 Heating Levels & 1-10 Hour Auto Off, ETL Certified Heated Throw Blanket Mach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MLnTz-y6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevated Warmth: Wemore electric heated blanket features 200GSM crystal velvet minky dot to decompress and 200GSM wool-warm Sherpa for max warm-keeping. The heated throw blanket heats up within minutes while keeping warm long after power is off. Upgraded Heating / Timer Settings: The electric blanket throw offer 10 heating levels (86°F - 122°F) to customize your comfort level. Smartly arranged coils make sure the heat is evenly distributed around the body. The heated blanket throw turns off in 1 - 10 hours on a smart timer to ensure absolute safety. Overheat Protection: The heating blanket is ETL certified to pass all set standards. Engineered with overheat protection, power is cut off automatically once the controller detects temperature over 140°F from improper use, bunching, folding of the heated blankets. Using the Blanket: The electric heated blanket is turned on H mode by default on a 3 hour auto-off timer. When the heated throw is heating up above level 4 for more than 3 hours, the system will automatically bump down to level 4 heating until the timer is out. Easy to Care: The Heating blanket is machine washable and tumble dry low, do not bleach / iron / dry clean. Please read the user guide carefully before using the product. In case you have any issue, please reach us and we'll resolve to your full satisfaction. Twin Size Heated Blanket : The portable heated blanket is sized in 50 x 60 inches for ultimate portability. It's great for lounging, napping, or resting on the couch or bed. 9 inch long cable provides the greatest flexibility in using. It also doubles as a super soft Blanket throw once removed from the controller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MLnTz-y6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wemore","source_asin":"B09ZHTQZV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZHTQZV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZHTQZV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697019,"name":"PoachPod Egg Poacher Lifter and Two 3 Inch Non-Stick Stainless Steel Poaching Tool Set by Fusionbrands","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KRLCCH3fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It has never been easier to prepare your favorite poached eggs. Just boil some water, crack the eggs into the Fusionbrands PoachPod and take the cups out with the lifter when its ready. Flip eggs onto your plate, toast or English muffin. Serve and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KRLCCH3fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poach Pod","source_asin":"B00OOA3UTU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OOA3UTU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OOA3UTU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697020,"name":"Ambesonne Vintage Curtains, Retro Composition Vintage Paper with Stars Rockets Western Halloween Illustration, Living Room Bedroom Window Drapes 2 Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lB1ky+CwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Satin Imported Your purchase will help victims of recent major earthquakes in Turkey since we donate a percentage of our profits to local NGOs helping with quake relief efforts. 84 Inches long x 108 Inches wide - Measurements are the total of 2 curtain panels together. Made in Turkey Set of 2 curtain panels - Suitable size for most living rooms and bedrooms, Unique. Genuine. Fun. Machine washable - On cold delicate cycle, tumble dry on low. Features a 2.5-inch rod pocket. Made from - High-quality silky satin polyester blend. Provides an elegant look and silky soft touch! Adds great perspective - Bold graphics printed with state of the art digital printing technology.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lB1ky+CwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B07Y5Q27DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y5Q27DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y5Q27DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697021,"name":"3 Pcs Assorted Fall Decorative Pumpkins Velvet Foam Pumpkins Fabric Pumpkins in Orange Teal Blue White for Fall Farmhouse Wedding Centerpiece Hallowee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715CeRkJsBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes Set of 3 Velvet Pumpkins Fabric Pumpkins in orange, teal and ivory. These pumpkins are a festive addition to modern rustic farmhouse decor, they are also great gift ideas for holidays. Color: The set of velvet pumpkins features orange, teal and ivory, topped with realistic brown stems for a rustic look. The colors are flexible for all season, which make them the perfect accent pieces for your home decor every day! You can use the teal pumpkin during Halloween season to raise the awareness about food allergies. Size: Each fall pumpkin is appr. 6.7\" tall and 6.3\" wide. In a medium size, they are perfect for meeting assorted decorating needs, ideal to fill up bowls or baskets, or to create classy table decoration for farmhouse Thanksgiving, fall wedding and special events. Material: Velvet fabric pumpkins are handmade from soft and velvet fabric, stuffed with pumpkin shaped styrofoam balls and topped with realistic painted resin stems. Beautifully made with fine details, artificial pumpkins are durable that you can keep them around all year. Display Velvet pumpkins on your mantel, hearth, entryway, dining table, coffee table, shelves, console table, kitchen counter, floor, stairs, tabletops, porch or any spot in your place. They are great to add a chic look for rustic wedding centerpieces, farmhouse Thanksgiving table decoration, autumn tablescapes, bowl display, Halloween porch display, Teal Pumpkin Project, fall arrangements, make wonderful gifts for a housewarming, fall wedding, baby shower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715CeRkJsBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B0969W9XGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0969W9XGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0969W9XGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697022,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast-Iron 3-1/2-Quart Round Wide French Oven, Dune","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oATRvoNRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Wider and shallower than the classic Le Creuset model, this low-profile round French oven holds up to 3-1/2 quarts and measures approximately 10 by 12-1/2 by 5-1/2 inches overall. Its shorter side walls and wide shape expose ingredients, facilitate efficient liquid evaporation, and provide a greater surface area for even browning--great for a variety of recipes and techniques, from stirring a rich risotto on the stovetop to browning ingredients before slow cooking. Made of heavy-duty cast iron, the cookware's colorful, long-lasting exterior enamel resists chipping and cracking, while its durable, nonreactive sand-colored interior enamel offers a smooth surface for cooking and an optimal palette for food presentation. As cast iron is unexcelled for even heat distribution and superior heat retention, and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the oven browns and cooks food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating, cooking on the stovetop, or finishing in the oven. Two loop cast-iron side handles help ensure a steady grip during transport--even when wearing bulky oven mitts, and the unit's secure-fitting lid locks in heat and moisture while cooking. The lid also comes fitted with a black phenolic knob that will withstand an oven's heat up to 350 degrees F. Beautiful enough for the table yet durable enough to outlive its lifetime limited warranty, the French oven can be safely used on any stovetop, including induction, and should be hand washed for best results. Amazon.com Beautiful enough for the table and durable enough to outlive its lifetime warranty against defects, this heavy, round, 3-1/2-quart French oven is perfect for preparing and ceremoniously serving dishes like cassoulet and vegetable soup. The cast-iron cookware provides fast, even heat distribution, while its exterior and interior are clad in two coats of enamel, which prevents foods from sticking and is impervious to acids and odors. The unit browns and cooks food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating. The knob on its heavy, tight-fitting lid is oven-safe to 450 degrees F, and the cookware is safe to use on any stovetop, including induction. Sturdy loop handles facilitate carrying from the oven or stovetop to the table, and the piece is dishwasher-safe for quick cleanup. Like all Le Creuset cast-iron products, it's hand cast in a one-of-a-kind sand mold and hand finished at the Le Creuset factory in France. The French oven measures 9 by 11-1/2 by 5-3/5 inches. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oATRvoNRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B000OR285Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000OR285Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000OR285Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697023,"name":"Little Critterz \"Migra\" Leatherback Sea Turtle LC226","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+X6XOdwyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ittle Critterz began years ago in the beautiful town of Bellagio, on Lake Como in northern Italy. Our founders discovered exquisite animal figurines in a small shop which they then sourced and further developed into the exquisite line you see today. And so Little Critterz was born. Our miniatures are crafted in the lush mountains and verdant plains of Thailand where people have cared for and loved animals since the beginning of their national story. Each figurine is hand crafted and hand painted by skilled artisans using brushes only a few hairs thick. Little Critterz product line has expanded to include Ornaments, Jewelry, Animal Patches, Animal Pins, and more on the way. The team at Little Critterz takes inspiration from the diversity of the animal world and delights in the wonderment both children and adults can feel when encountering the natural world for the first time; reminding us to protect of this planet’s amazing creatures. We take pride in sharing their stories so that we can protect these animals and their habitats. This wonderful planet and its creatures should be a heritage we can all admire and enjoy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+X6XOdwyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Little Critterz","source_asin":"B007Z9Q0PI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007Z9Q0PI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007Z9Q0PI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
