window.products.push({"id":697217,"name":"Enlightened Ambience Patchouli Pine Scented Ivory Votive Candles 10 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t5A7BIPbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SEXY, WOODLAND, SCENTED VOTIVE CANDLES, PATCHOULI, IVORY, LONG-BURNING, MADE IN U.S.A., BULK SET OF 10 candles. This musky, sultry scent will fill your home with the aroma patchouli with strong woodland pine notes. Candles can create a mood and set the stage for any event, and ours are ideal for making a room feel comfortable and cozy. They are long burning (14-16 hours). Scented votive candles are the perfect gift for a house warming, hostess, and adult birthday or for any holiday occasion. These scented candles are even burning and full of fragrance filling your room with scent. They are made by hand here in U.S.A. Formed around a cotton wick measuring 2 inches tall from base to the top of the wax these candles are 1 3/8 inches in diameter. . We recognize that fragrance preference is very personal, so for this reason we offer a 100% money back guarantee with no hassles - we have many fragrances and we want to be your Amazon candle supplier. These candles burn best when placed in a cylinder votive holder with a 2 inch diameter. These are not meant to burn on a flat surface. The burn time will be greatly reduced if placed in a bubble holder or on a flat surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t5A7BIPbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enlightened Ambience","source_asin":"B01M4O9VDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M4O9VDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M4O9VDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
