window.products.push({"id":697250,"name":"Sleepsia Full Body Pillow for Adults - 20x54 Long Pillow with Memory Foam Shredded | Ultra Smooth Breathable Bed Pillows for Side Sleepers with Washab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y1GFsYilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"20 x 54 Body Pillow for Adults - This Long pillow brings Absolute Comfort for Side sleepers. Shredded Memory Foam Full body pillow provides additional relief and enough support for your body while sleeping in bed. These long pillows fits perfectly to the original contour as it conforms to the shape of your body. Side Sleeper Pillow - Sleepsia Long Body pillow is your perfect companion, be it sleeping, enjoying TV or just taking it easy on the couch. Body and pregnancy pillow encourages side sleeping and further reduces the likelihood of snoring. Shredded Memory Foam Pillow - Sleepsia Leg Pillows for sleeping use shredded memory foam to provide evenly support to every body part, all night. With viscolelastic material inside the pillow, the pillow supports the natural curve of your body and provides an optimal firmness promoting good alignment for your legs, back, and hips. Cuddle Pillow with Super Smooth Fabric - The fabric is skin-friendly and breathable and is filled with high-quality fiber (100% Polyster, Circular Jacquard, 400 GSM) Medium density and supportive, keeping you cool and comfortable all night long. Machine Washable Cover - The soft and smooth outer cover of this long body pillow is made from a breathable, noiseless fabric that will give you a comfortable deep rest after a long day. The pillow Cover can be machine washed and dried. It is easy to maintain and clean. Stringent Quality Checks - Resting is easy with these long body pillows as stringent quality checks are maintained in manufacturing these pillows. This ensures safety, quality, and compatibility with the product. If you find any smell on the shredded memory foam, we suggest you to remove the cover, wash and dry it and the smell will go away within 24 to 36 hours. Christmas Gifts Black Friday Deals Cyber Monday Sales- Kick off your holiday shopping with a body pillow. It is great for holding, sleeping and relaxing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y1GFsYilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepsia","source_asin":"B0C6K9WRHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6K9WRHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6K9WRHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
