window.products.push({"id":697294,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Heather Flannel 5.4-Ounce Sheet Set, King, Blue Heather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ECoZyj8BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Recycled flannel sheet set are extra soft and cozy to add comfort to any bedroom. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com 5.4-ounce flannel sheet set for soft, cozy comfort year round. view larger Heather Flannel Sheet Set What You Need to Know: Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases Luxuriously soft hand Luxuriously soft hand 12-inch-deep pockets on fitted sheet 12-inch-deep pockets on fitted sheet Variety of colors available Variety of colors available Coordinates with Pinzon heather flannel blanket (sold separately) Coordinates with Pinzon heather flannel blanket (sold separately) Imported; machine washable Imported; machine washable Pinzon Heather Flannel 5.4-Ounce Sheet Set Can't Get Much Cozier Transform your beloved bed into the ultimate comfort zone with this heather flannel sheet set by Pinzon. The unadorned ensemble combines superior quality and value with a smooth, soft hand for luxury you'll love falling into at the end of the day. The 5.4-ounce flannel sheet set provides a luscious layer of warmth that's especially suitable for those chilly fall and winter months. You might find yourself using the set year-round, though, thanks to it sensational softness. Who doesn't love a bit of cozy, bedtime bliss? Colorful Heather Effect The flannel sheet set achieves its solid heather effect by weaving together a variety of yarns, both colored and white. The sheet set comes in a choice of four muted yet captivating colors including Light Gray, Dark Gray, Blue, and Khaki. Ideal for a master bedroom or a welcoming guest room, the flannel sheet set provides a fashionable foundation for existing bedding and beautifully coordinates with Pinzon's matching heather flannel blanket (sold separately). Variety of Sizes Available Offered in Queen, King, and California King, the sheet set includes a flat sheet, a fitted sheet, and two pillowcases. Both the flat sheet and pillowcases are generously sized for ample coverage, and the fitted sheet provides 12-inch-deep pockets and stretchy elastic all the way around to ensure it stays securely on the mattress. Machine Washable Made in Portugal, the imported 5.4-ounce flannel sheet set is machine-washable and can go in the dryer for easy care. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ECoZyj8BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00BS55KT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BS55KT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BS55KT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
