window.products.push({"id":697377,"name":"Serta Monaco Collection Arm Accent Chair, Biscuit Bonded Leather,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R1t4s30nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From a brand synonymous with quality, comfort and style, the sleek and fashionable style of the Serta Monaco Collection Bonded Leather Accent Chair helps transforms your apartment or vacation home's living space into a warmer and more inviting atmosphere. This accent chair is made with hardwood materials that provide stability and strength to its durable design. High-density foam and poly-fibers surround individually wrapped coils to deliver relaxing comfort you'll look forward to kicking back on after a long day at the office. Finished in a smooth, bonded leather and featuring square footers in an espresso finish, this small accent chair blends its contemporary style with undeniable comfort. No tools are required for set up, so you can quickly assemble and disassemble this Serta accent chair with ease. It comes in one portable box that can be carried around tight corners and through narrow doorways, making it a great choice for fitting in an apartment or smaller sized space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R1t4s30nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serta","source_asin":"B019DKT378","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019DKT378","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019DKT378","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697378,"name":"People in Sun by Edward Hopper, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IAr7I2ljL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped multi panel canvas art set features decorative tiles with Mayan designs. Most days, one would find Marion Rose putting on her favorite music or playing an old video before settling in to paint for the day in her spacious studio, especially once the winter chill set in. Her work is influenced by past masters such as Joaquin Sorolla, Tom Thomson, Carl Rungius, Bob Kuhn, and many others that work today in a variety of subjects and media. She also studied printmaking, life painting and drawing in college in her 30's. Her subjects come from her life of traveling enthusiastically as often as she could, both close to home or across the ocean. Sketching and studying animals were a favorite pastime, setting an excellent foundation for creating authentic work. Texture and richly colored paint applied generously by knife or brush strokes capture the essence of a subject's spirit and demeanor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IAr7I2ljL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B074CRNKJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074CRNKJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074CRNKJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
