window.products.push({"id":697466,"name":"Minos Moka Pot 6-Cup Espresso Maker - Stainless Steel And Heatproof Handle - Suitable for Induction, Electric And Ceramic Stovetops","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DT4DqMglL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you're a true coffee lover and are looking for a truly authentic, romantic and delicious cup of coffee, this will be the best thing you'll read about today. Brewing coffee with a Moka Pot, designed and first released in 1933, is still considered the world's most authentic way to brew a strong, delicious cup of coffee. Today's Moka Pots still have the same classic look to it, but we're proud to tell you that we've practically \"upgraded\" the way people brew coffee from Moka Pots. Introducing the Minos Moka Pot. Designed with heavy stainless steel, it is created to last. Stainless steel is much stronger, and can stand intense heat more than aluminum (which is what most Moka Pots are made of), giving it a much longer lifetime than other brands. We also gave the classic look an update with a more sleek, elegant and upscale feel. And because of the new design, it is much easier to clean up. Using The Minos Moka Pot to brew a delicious cup of coffee is an art, and can become your daily morning ritual or meditation that rewards you with a strong wake-me-up. It is very simple and easy to use, and was made for coffee lovers and enthusiasts of all kinds. The Minos Moka Pot comes in 6-cup size, which can perfectly suit your needs! Now experience a truly romantic and authentic cup of delicious Italian-style coffee with the Minos Moka Pot. Get yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DT4DqMglL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Minos","source_asin":"B077JWNNKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077JWNNKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077JWNNKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697467,"name":"Maustic Guitar Mug, Music Gifts for Men Women, Guitar Gifts for Guitar Players, Christmas Birthday Gifts for Music Lovers, Music Teacher Gifts, Cerami","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uJwG0falL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT GIFTS FOR MUSIC LOVERS: This well made super trendy guitar mug will be a perfect music gift for guitar players, guitarists, guitar enthusiasts, music lovers, musicians, music teachers to drive them crazy and help them stimulate musical inspiration. You can give this awesome gift away to them on their birthday, Christmas, Teachers Day, Mothers Day, Fathers Day. They will absolutely love it. CREATIVE COFFEE MUG DESIGN: The cool designs of the red electric guitar mug handle and the beating notes on the mug will make your music-loving friends adore the unique mug. The handle of the cup is quite whimsical and funny to look at and also easy to grip. The beating music notes also remind of us the pulsing of sound waves. The funny music mug also comes with a creative plastic vinyl record coaster which makes better insulation. REASONABLE COFFEE CUP CAPACITY: The music gifts for men hold a generous capacity of 13 Oz of both hot and cold beverages such as coffee, hot tea, hot chocolate, ice beer, orange juice and etc. The well designed guitar cup will help you start your new day bringing you good mood in the morning. When you are off duty and come back home, a cup of tea with this super lovely mug will help you get rid of fatigue of the day. VERSATILE USAGE FOR VARIOUS OCCASIONS: The guitar gifts for guitar players are versatile and practical, which can be used in many occasions such as home, garden, office, musical party and music themed restaurants and bars. Not only for drinking purpose, it can be also served as home or office decoration, pen holder, small vase and etc. The guitar coffee mug is both inspirational and pragmatic gift to bring music lovers joy and inspiration. DECENT QUALITY PRESENT FOR MUSICIANS: The attractive music teacher gifts are made from premium quality food grade material, safe and durable for daily use. It is detailed perfectly with vivid color and clear printings. It can be put into dishwashers or microwaves and there will not be sparkles and the printing is uneasy fall off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uJwG0falL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maustic","source_asin":"B0BHDMRYCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHDMRYCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHDMRYCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697468,"name":"DEWBIN Thanksgiving Decorations for Home, Large Size 4-Layered Wood Scarecrows Block with Count Your Blessing Lettered and LED Lights for Fall Decor, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EZxtvRX+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【THANKSGIVING DECORATIONS FOR HOME】Celebrating the Changing Seasons with Fun Fall Decorations. This scarecrows wood block fall decor with shining LED lights and the text on the wood blocks perfectly create the harvest atmosphere of autumn, to convey blessings and share the joy with family and friends around. Orange color will add much fall feel to your home so that it can fit perfectly into your decor. 【SAFE ＆ ENVIRONMENTALLY MATERIALS】 This Thanksgiving decoration is made of wood which is odorless, thick, unbreakable and safe to use. And special process creates a smooth surface without burrs. And it makes use of reclaimed wood which can protect our environment. The superior printing technique keeps it from fading so that the clearly visible lettering on the rectangular blocks is difficult to erase. The wooden sign is durable because of its excellent craftsmanship. 【FREE-STANDING TO WIDE APPLICATION】 The size of the wood is 11.6’’L x 2.4’’W x 12.6’’H. This right thickness allows it to stand firmly and easily on the table, effectively reducing the drop caused by a collision in daily use. Add this set to any shelf, table, or fireplace mantel to add a warm finishing touch. Whether you are starting your home decor collection or adding to your existing one, this sign is the perfect addition to your beautiful home. 【GIFTS OF THANKSGIVING 】This fall wood sign decor is a nice present for the one you care about. You can give this lovely scarecrows wood block to your family, friends or loved ones. Thanksgiving and other such fall festivals would be appropriate. To bless them with good luck and happiness, deliver a grateful mood and celebrate this wonderful festival. 【WE ARE STAYING WITH YOU AFTER SALE】 If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We provide 90 days warranty and 24/7 online support customer service. If there is a major problem with our products, we will issue you a full refund or a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EZxtvRX+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEWBIN","source_asin":"B0B2DBJYJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DBJYJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DBJYJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
