window.products.push({"id":697507,"name":"Christmas Decoration German Pyramid - 11 Inches - Wood Nativity Scene Play Set - Table Top Holiday Decor - Nativity Play Carousel with 4 Candle Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s0A44c48L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is suggested that the Christmas pyramid is a predecessor of the Christmas tree. These pyramids are not limited to Christmas: in the Erzgebirge there was a custom of dancing a pyramid decked with garlands and flowers\", at the summer solstice. Not actually pyramid-shaped, the Christmas pyramid is a kind of carousel with several levels, and others with more secular motifs such as mountain-folk, forests, and other scenes from the everyday life of people in the Erzgebirge. The spinning motion of the pyramids is traditionally achieved with the help of candles whose rising heat spins a propeller above. Product Descriptions Dimensions: 11 Inches x Base 7 ¼ X 6 inches In the Box: 1 x Christmas Pyramid with Candle Holders Attached 1 X Fan Blades Holder 10 X Fan Blades 1 x Manual & Instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s0A44c48L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA SUPREME","source_asin":"B07YFBSTKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFBSTKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFBSTKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
