window.products.push({"id":697531,"name":"American Flag String Lights, 8.5Ft 4th of July Decorations Outdoor String Lights with USA Flag Lights, Plug in Indoor Patriotic String Lights for Inde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+lZaOymoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨4th of july decorations string lights: 8.5Ft American flag string lights with 14 mini incandescent bulbs (4 spare), Each bulbs 0.84W, classic American flags lights conbine with mini incandescent lights glow warm and pleasant atmosphere, enhance the patriotic holiday atmosphere. ✨ End-to-end connectable : Independence day decorations lights with 2 ways to connect, Male plug and female plug connect/ male plug and male plug connect. total length 8.5 ft, 4th of july flag decorations lights with 24'' lead with male plug, 8'' spacing between heart, 6\" tail with female connector. rated 216W, red white blue American flag string lights can connected up to 25 Sets ✨Reliable and Long Lasting: Plug in american flag lights is made of hight quality pvc material, IP44 Waterproof, UL listed for outdoor & indoor use, perfect for July fourth, Labor Day, Presidents Day, Memorial Day, Independence Day, Veterans Day, American Party, Flag Day, Christmas, New Year and many other celebration occasions. ✨ Energy Saving patriotic fairy string lights: Hanging 4th of july decorations lights no batteries required, red white blue USA flag string lights with 2 3A fuses in male plug work at the same time, more steady and durable than other battery operated american flag lights, independence day decorations lights great for desks, windows,room, living room, tree, fence or porch, tend decorations and lighting ✨ Special Present: It's a great gifts for kids and adults, cute flag string lights perfect for your patriotic party, Thanksgiving, Christmas, birthday, home, window, wedding, parties and other celebration occasions. Please contact the seller directly if you have any quality problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+lZaOymoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOOTHY","source_asin":"B0B5QLP3G8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5QLP3G8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5QLP3G8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
