window.products.push({"id":697543,"name":"Truweigh Enigma Digital Coffee Scale - (500g X 0.01g Silver) Digital Food Scale - Coffee Weight Scale - High Precision Scale - Automatic Counting Scal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61efI0CEEwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Truweigh is a leader in the kitchen food scale industry, with a wide range in scales for every market, we have a pocket scale to fit every need. The ENIGMA 500g x 0.01g scale is known for high precision and accuracy making this a top of the line barista scale. All Truweigh digital kitchen scales come with a 10 year limited warranty protecting your purchase. The ENIGMA digital scale is incredibly versatile with a very elegant design. The extra-large 4\" square platform, high precision sensor, and included expansion trays make the ENIGMA one of the most versatile espresso scale around. For safe storage and transportation, the large expansion tray fits over the smart scale while the smaller tray keeps the small kitchen scale platform covered and protected. Our Truweigh ENIGMA 500g portable scale comes with many features, built-in overload protection to help prevent long term damage to your powder scale. Our digital gram scale also comes with a green back-lit LCD screen for easy reading, as well as an auto shut off feature to prevent your portable food scale from draining its batteries. The automatic piece counting makes the ENIGMA stand out from all other scales on the market! The Truweigh ENIGMA baking scale has a max capacity of 500g and a readability of 0.01g making this a high accuracy scale. It also comes with our in-depth instruction manual to make sure you utilize all features that come with our Truweigh ENIGMA herb scale. With two weighing platforms, the stainless steel scale surface or the plastic case, use either option that fits your weighing needs. Truweigh also included two AAA batteries, making our jewelry scale ready to use as soon as you receive it. The Truweigh ENIGMA digital weight scale crosses over as a versatile counter top scale. It can be used as a scale for packages, reloading equipment, soap making supplies, scale for food, travel scale, resin scale for DIY projects, meat scale, gold scale, and so much more. With impeccable accuracy trust in Truweigh to help make sure your next meal or at home DIY project is finished with precision and accurate weights. It converts automatically between: G / OZ / OZT / DWT / CT / GN.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61efI0CEEwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Truweigh","source_asin":"B08M9Q4SBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M9Q4SBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M9Q4SBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697544,"name":"Slice Solutions 9-Inch Round Sectional Cake Pan Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mj17GClJL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you love baking then you know of the many problems that tend to occur during the process. Slice Solutions has created a sectioner 9\" Round Cake Pan that is sized perfectly for the pan that you place into the pan before cooking. One cooked and cooled the sectioner is removed and you have 8 presliced, perfectly sized, cake slices! Problem 2: Removing the cake slices from the pan is not easy, even with a small turner you tend to crush at least the first one or two cake slices just to get into the pan. Slice Solutions has developed a pan with a removable bottom that eliminates this issue. After removing the sectioner you place the entire pan, centered, on the included wire lifting rack. In doing so, the removable bottom stays on this rack and the outer pan drops underneath allowing for you to easily use a small turner to remove the cake slice. You can also use sectioner as a cutter after baking is completed if desired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Mj17GClJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slice Solutions","source_asin":"B001874B0Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001874B0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001874B0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
