window.products.push({"id":697546,"name":"Cyra Electric Fireplace 40\" Wall Mounted Electric Fireplace Inserts LED Fireplace with 3 Colors, Temperature, Remote Control, Timer, Carbon & Crystal ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618h+0KjlpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN DESIGN: The electric fireplace wall mounted has a flat tempered glass front panel and a digital LED display for long lasting use. Including brackets that let you hang on the led fireplace heater everywhere with a modern appearance. The wall fireplace electric with remote control is suitable for residential, office, hotel, and restaurant use. ADJUSTABLE & REALISTIC FLAME: The faux fireplace has 3 different flame colors 1.Yellow 2. blue 3.yellow+blue, which will create a different atmosphere. Electric Fireplaces have 3 led bed colors with a special automatic change (Red, Blue, and Red & Blue). It comes with crystal stone and wood for decoration options, with a colorful flame to bring you an incredibly realistic look. The included carbon fire logs and crystal stones create an authentic feel.Set up the way you want. MULTIPLE OPERATION MODES: Safety and Comfort: ETL Certificate Approved. It also has auto-heat kill safety to avoid the superheating. The heat is good for maintaining the natural humidity within the air without making the room too dry. The electric fireplace inserts can be operated either manually or by remote control as demanded. Remote control includes power on/off, 1-8 hour timer setting, temperature setting, heat setting, flame and bed flame color setting. All functions have individual buttons to make it easier to use. Including screen display, the function was chosen for convenience. KEEPS YOUR PLACE WARM IN STYLE: The wall fireplace electric with remote control has AC120V/60Hz, 750W/1500W heat modes provide for the temperature and energy saving purpose. Temperature control system can be adjusted between 62°F to 82°F. Set the temperature first, and the electric heater will stop working once the set temperature is reached. SAFE & EASY INSTALLATION: Our wall mounted fireplace is easy to install with the step-by-step instructions given in the manual. Adult assembly is required. Our Proprietary Packaging ensures the safe delivery of the wall mounted fireplace to your home. In addition, the electric wall fireplace comes with a 90 Day Manufacturer’s Warranty and, in the unlikely event that you are not satisfied with our Electric Fire place for the wall, you can contact our customer service for a return/refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618h+0KjlpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naomi Home","source_asin":"B0BM444YKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM444YKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM444YKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
