window.products.push({"id":697667,"name":"18+3 Pack Reusable Food Storage Bags with Drain Rack ,BPA Free Reusable Freezer Bags (6 Gallon & 6 Sandwich & 6 Snack Bags),Extra Thick Leak Proof Reu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D1eaLUP1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♻【FOOD GRADE MATERIAL】: Ceephouge reusable storage bags are made of food-grade PEVA material which is PVC-free, lead-free, chloride-free and BPA-free.Safer and more secure to use. ​It can still be recycled after multiple uses.Do you know? Every disposable plastic bags you've ever used is still out there somewhere in a landfill or the ocean.In order to protect our planet, please reduce the use of plastic bags. Join us and save money while protecting the planet! ♻【BONUS:3 LITTLE ASSISTANTS】:The reusable freezer bags set come with two small cleaning brushes and a drying rack. Simply brush gently with warm or cold water, the cleaned bags can be placed on the drying rack to dry.Compared to others who use cups to dry reusable sandwich bags, it can save more space in the kitchen and bring you a cleaner and simpler kitchen. ♻【MORE NUMBER OF GALLON BAGS】:The reusable food storage bags sets includes 6 reusable gallon bags(11*10.6 inches),6 reusable sandwich bags(8.7*7.3 inches),6 reusable snack bags(8.7*4.7 inches).For the same price you can get more number of gallon bags, large capacity can store more food, do not have to worry about the food bought can not fit in the bag. It can also be used as a sandwich bag. ♻【UPGRADE LEAK-PROOF & REINFORCED EDGES】: The reusable sandwich bags with upgraded double-seal zipper and double-seal edge design,that is more sealed, leak-proof, waterproof and hygienic.The sealing performance effectively prevents different food odors from mixing, saying goodbye to onion-smelling refrigerators.Drinks,soup and other liquids will not spill.And no need to worry about food getting wet from melting ice in the freezer.Reinforced the edges,the bags is not easy to break. ♻【FREEZER SAFE & KEEP FOOD FRESH】: The reusable ziplock bags can also be used to preserve food in the freezer, which can effectively prevent freezer burn, avoid food dehydration and discoloration, keeping the original flavor of food. When you open the refrigerator, you will find that chicken doesn't get frost bitten or taste 'off' anymore.(Please note:This reusable food storage bags are NOT suitable for DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE and OVEN). ♻【GREAT CUSTOMER SERVICE】Ceephouge offers a full day after-sales service. If you are not satisfied with our reusable food bags or any other problem, please send us your issues. We will provide the best solution to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D1eaLUP1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ceephouge","source_asin":"B0967XC8TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0967XC8TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0967XC8TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
