window.products.push({"id":697834,"name":"Pavo Personalized Fleece Blanket to My Son from Mom - Never Feel That You are Alone - Customized Gift for Birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Graduatio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zMCUVXiWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ [EXCLUSIVE DESIGNS] Finding thoughtful gifts for your son isn't always easy. That's why we are here to help. There's no gift that speaks \"I love you\" more than a blanket with meaningful messages. This super soft and cozy blanket is a perfect way to tell your son that \"I'm always right there in your heart.\" At Pavo, our highly skilled designers always cater to your needs and strive to turn every gift idea into reality by handling each request with great care ✅ [CUSTOM TAILORED FOR SPECIAL OCCASIONS] Cherish your loved one's celebrations by sharing precious memories with our customized blanket. Pavo's custom fleece blanket will be the perfect present for your parents, spouse, siblings, children, and friends on various occasions like Birthday, Valentine's, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Engagement, Wedding, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas, etc. ✅ [MULTIPLE SIZES - MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS] Pavo's customized blanket comes in various sizes 30\"x40\", 50\"x60\", and 60\"x80\". Hence, our blanket can be used as sofa blanket, bed blanket, bed sheets, tapestry wall hanging, or a great addition to your comforter set. It is also perfect for outdoor activity like camping or go to the beach. Whether you want it in your bedroom for extra warmth, or in the living room for a stylish touch, this throw can keep you comfort in any space. ✅ [EXQUISITE FLEECE FABRIC] Each fleece blanket features a premium polyester print for beautiful color vibrancy, even after washing. This blanket is reversible with one side mimicking soft fur while the other is smooth fleece. The fabric is tested to be long lasting and durable while also keeping you cozy. ✅ [GUARANTEE] Your satisfaction is our first priority. If you have any issues with the product, please feel free to contact us to get a replacement or a full refund. We will try our best to accommodate every inconvenience and problem that our customers encounter with great care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zMCUVXiWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavo","source_asin":"B08V914LHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V914LHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V914LHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697835,"name":"Jitsu Goods Fabric Lined Wooden Decorative Ottoman Tray | Kitchen Breakfast Serving with Cutout Wood Handles | Black & White Boho Pattern | Coffee Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BMg0hEPSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅BREAKFAST SERVED! Do you love the idea of breakfast in bed?! Perhaps some popcorn and candy for movie night? Or tea and cookies for a rainy afternoon? These are all possibilities for using your new serving tray! You can envision all of the things you can now do with our tray! Certainly, a Sunday brunch is one of them! Our tray has easy carrying handles for balance and comfortable carrying! It is large enough for tons of snacks for you and friends! Specs: (15.8 X 11.8 X 2 inches) ✅QUALITY GUARANTEED! The quality and style of our serving tray are unmatched! In the mail, you can expect to open a beautiful dark wood tray, with a gorgeous boho pattern on the inside! It's durable, yet light weight. The fabric acts as a natural coaster! Don't worry, It's very easy to clean with a wipe! If you are a lover of rustic, boho farmhouse our decorative serving tray fits in them all! Always have our elegant tray ready for afterschool snacks and ladies cocktail night! ✅LOVELY DECOR! Ottoman trays have the ability to add the slightest detail to a room! If you are into home decor you know the small things matter! Our tray looks gorgeous as an accent piece! For the coffee table, envision your remotes, candles, flowers, and novels! These are typically scattered but now they have a designated place! Our coffee table tray cleans up while looking amazing! You can also stage it on a mantle or centerpiece! Add flowers/succulents for a cute effect! ✅EXQUISITE GIFT! Our fabric-lined ottoman tray is absolutely stunning and practical! The soft, elegant fabric plus dark wood creates quite the decor piece! Our product is the perfect gift to give as a housewarming gift! No matter the occasion your loved one is going to adore our serving tray! The fabric lining is unique and adds texture! It prevents from slipping or spillage as well! Give the gift of breakfast in bed! Endless mimosas = priceless reactions! ✅100% Customer Dedication - If you aren't happy, we'll fix it! Our #1 priority is you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BMg0hEPSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jitsu Goods","source_asin":"B0845W97YH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0845W97YH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0845W97YH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
