window.products.push({"id":697925,"name":"Ice Cream Scooper, Heavy Duty, Best Ice Cream Scooper Spoon with Comfortable Handle, Professional Quality, Rust-Proof and Solid, Great Kitchen or Hous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RQQqDF6zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE LAST ICE CREAM SCOOP YOU’LL EVER NEED TO BUY No More Frustration Digging into ice cream is meant to be a treat, not a mini forearm workout you have to mentally prepare for! We designed our professional ice cream scoop to bring the joy back to treating yourself. Dealing with rock hard ice cream? Your forearms need not fear. With a unique edge and ergonomic shape, the Soltam scooper pushes through the frozen deliciousness with amazing ease, releases it without any hassle, and creates perfectly round scoops you’ll want to show off. Whether you’re preparing cones or sundaes, a decadent dessert or simply prepping for that movie, you’ll never have to worry whenever the thought of ice cream crosses your mind. Built Perfectly Solid We’ve been creating kitchen gadgets and cooking essentials for over 65 years. And we’ve channeled our experience and expertise amassed over 6 decades to create an ice cream scoop you’ll never feel the need to replace. At Soltam, we’re huge fans of keeping things nice and simple. That’s why we steered away from moving parts and gimmicky trigger blades, and instead opted for a solid build brought to life by extra-durable materials. The heavy-duty metal never rusts, bends, or breaks, and the premium handle treats you to great grip and a comfortable scoop every time. Here’s what makes our scooper a cut above the rest: - Heavy-duty materials ensure decades of durability. - Fitted with a high-quality handle for scooping comfort. - The unique edge pushes through frozen ice cream with ease. - Designed to quickly release ice cream without any sticking. - Creates beautiful, round scoops for tantalizing presentation. - The simple yet striking look adds a premium touch to your kitchen. - Backed by a no-hassle, 100% money-back guarantee. Go ahead, make scooping ice cream a smile-sparking affair!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RQQqDF6zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soltam Professional Cookware","source_asin":"B07MPXFCD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MPXFCD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MPXFCD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":697926,"name":"6Pcs Fluffy Faux Fur Duvet Cover Sets,Shaggy Fuzzy Plush Bedding Set(1Faux Fur Quilt Cover with Velvet Fabric Inner+1Flannel Flat Sheet+2 Pillowcases+","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dAsrEsvlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Twin Size Package Includes:】-6 PCS shaggy fluffy queen size bedding set includes:1Faux Fur Duvet Cover:66\"x90\"in/168x228cm+1 Crystal Velvet Flat Sheet:68\"x92\"in/172x234cm+2 Pillowcases:20\"x30\"in/50x75cm+2 Shaggy Heart Pillow.Duvet/comforter inside is not included,needed to be purchased separately.This duvet bedding cover is a great gift for everybody,every festival and special occasions. 【Comfortable Fuzzy fabric:】- The front of luxury ultra-soft duvet cover is made of plush fluffy microfiber long plush while the back is comfortable easy to sleep crystal velvet fabric. During cold winter,our Purelyho plush warm fuzzy flannel bedding set will provide constant warmth and comfort promptly. 【Perfect Hidden Zipper Corner Ties Design:】-The hidden zipper closure is more convenient and beautiful than other closure.We have a flap to cover the zipper closure so that it is invisible and durable,making no noises during moving.6 corner ribbon inside your duvet cover can help secure comforter in the right place from slipping into a pile.Keep the quilt flat at all times and keep you comfortable all night long. 【Luxury Design:】- If you choose our gray white blue tie-dyed soft warm comforter cover as your bedding to match,it will definitely add infinite warmth and fun to your room,bring you warmth and comfort,and let you quickly relieve your fatigue when you get home after a working day.Making the bedding more simple and elegant,giving you the most comfortable feel and warm atmosphere for a restful sleep.It is also very perfect to cuddle under during chilly days and nights. 【Clean and Care:】- Machine wash cool using mild,liquid Laundry Detergent.Avoid hang dry which will cause deformation.Do not bleach or Iron.It is recommend to clean before the first use.If you have any questions or dissatisfaction with the product,please feel free to contact us to ensure that your refund needs are met,and we will try our best to make you 100% satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dAsrEsvlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purelyho","source_asin":"B09CNTH8XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CNTH8XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CNTH8XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
