window.products.push({"id":697966,"name":"Hoople Stainless Steel Soap Bar Hand Wash Kitchen Gadget, Kitchen Gift, Strong Odor Absorber. Such as BBQ, Grill, Garlic, Onion, Fishing, Smoke, and R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BA5jVeLoL._AC_.jpg","description":"Function- Rubbing the bar removes any odor from your hands. Great for use after working with onions, fish, or garlic Material- Made of stainless steel, BPA free. It can be used normally after being taken out for a while. How to Use- Simply use this like a bar of soap,while rubbing it on your hands,soaking your hands in the water. If you want to remove the smell from you pet’s bed just put this soap bar half immersed in water then put it next to the pet’s bed. REMEMBER to prevent pets from swallowing it. Easy to Clean- Dishwasher safe for quick and easy clean up. Hand washing recommended. Tips: Some ingredients such as onion,garlic and fish will give off sulfur that causes the odor to stain your hands when you deal with them. This stainless steel soap bar would attract and combind with the sulfur to remove the unwanted oder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BA5jVeLoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOOPLE","source_asin":"B07D5LKP7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-697966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D5LKP7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D5LKP7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false})