window.products.push({"id":698000,"name":"Vidget 3-in-1 Active & Flexible Seating, Use as Fidget Seat, Stool or Desk in Classroom or Home, Improve Attention & Self-Regulation, Safe No-Tip Desi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fZjTWheGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fidget in your VidgetVidget 3-in-1 Flexible Seating is a patented design that inspires our bodies to move naturally and celebrates healthy learning! Fidgeting has proven to increase attention, focus, calmness and reduce frustration. 3-in-1 Active Seat - Supported Stool & Desk Surface all in oneThe Vidget can transform from an active seat into a desk surface or supported stool by just turning it over. The modularity and versatility of the patented Vidget 3-in-1 Flexible Seating System provides many opportunities for collaboration by allowing students and teachers to build their own environments based on individual and group needs. The side-to-side & front-to-back safe rocking motion helps students self-regulate by releasing energy while in control of their own physical movement. Teachers are able to focus on teaching while students are getting needed sensory input. Students with ADHD, Autism, and Sensory Processing Disorder will find the greatest benefit.Available in 5 sizes from - Toddler to Teen/Adult! (preK – college) Sensory Bumps in Side HandlesFidgety fingers naturally find ​the sensory bumps in side handles which provides a tactile and discrete texture to use when in need of extra sensory input. Molded bumps make it easier to clean and supports improved classroom management.Vidget 3-in-1 Flexible Seating Learning & Therapy BenefitsImproved attention & focussafe: not able to tip backwardsFacilitates core muscle developmentProvides sensory inputReduces tension and frustrationSupports inclusive learningDimensionsOverall dimensions: 20.4\" H x 16.4\" W x 21.7\" DSeat: 14'' H x 12.3'' DStool height: 15.8\" HDesk height: 21.5\" HOverall Product Weight: 8.5 lb. Maximum weight capacity: 250 lbs. Medium 14” Vidget is ideal for ages 6 – 9 years","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fZjTWheGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viggi Kids","source_asin":"B015OREE3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015OREE3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015OREE3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":698001,"name":"BLUE Q Shopper Foxy, 1 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hO5E9rgYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Attractive and built to last, Blue Q's reusable shopping totes are ideal for groceries, picnics, going to the beach and so much more-while leaving disposable waste behind! These large reusable bags stand up on their own, and are larger and stronger than their disposable counterpart, making them quite popular with grocery clerks. The small interior pocket is ideal for holding coupons, grocery lists, or a wallet. With waterproof construction, a reinforced floor panel, and super-strong recycled woven polypropylene and thick polyester thread seams, these bags will easily carry load of groceries! It's easy to make a sustainable statement your friends will notice with one of Blue Q's colorful, kitschy and edgy designs and prints. When you've finished shopping for the day, these reusable totes fold flat when empty for space saving and simple storage. Style: Foxy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hO5E9rgYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Q","source_asin":"B013RIZAF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-698001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013RIZAF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013RIZAF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
